@startuml
!theme plain
title Card Financial Milestones — Not a Single Flat State Machine
left to right direction

state "AUTHORIZATION" as AUTH {
  [*] --> REQUESTED
  REQUESTED --> APPROVED
  REQUESTED --> DECLINED
  REQUESTED --> UNKNOWN
  UNKNOWN --> APPROVED : authoritative result
  UNKNOWN --> DECLINED : authoritative result
}

state "CAPTURE" as CAP {
  [*] --> NOT_CAPTURED
  NOT_CAPTURED --> CAPTURE_REQUESTED
  CAPTURE_REQUESTED --> CAPTURE_ACCEPTED
  CAPTURE_REQUESTED --> CAPTURE_UNKNOWN
  CAPTURE_UNKNOWN --> CAPTURE_ACCEPTED : authoritative confirmation
}

state "CLEARING" as CLR {
  [*] --> NOT_PRESENTED
  NOT_PRESENTED --> PRESENTED
  PRESENTED --> CLEARING_ACCEPTED
  PRESENTED --> CLEARING_REJECTED
}

state "SCHEME SETTLEMENT" as SET {
  [*] --> POSITION_PENDING
  POSITION_PENDING --> POSITION_CONFIRMED
}

state "MERCHANT FUNDING" as FUND {
  [*] --> PAYOUT_NOT_DUE
  PAYOUT_NOT_DUE --> PAYOUT_SCHEDULED
  PAYOUT_SCHEDULED --> PAYOUT_SENT
  PAYOUT_SENT --> BANK_CONFIRMED
}

note bottom
These are separate parallel financial sub-lifecycles.
A single global transaction status would hide exceptions.
Payment network and processor rules may differ.
end note
@enduml